 ## Watchbill
 
 `watchbill.json` written with 11 watches, one per feature file. Ready for QM dispatch when the next role takes the deck.
 
+## Acceptance suite defects (2025-07-28)
+
+External Cypress acceptance suite reports two product defects the happy-dom harness does not reproduce:
+
+1. **Toggle checkbox visible during editing.** The `li.editing .view` CSS rule must hide the view container (and its toggle checkbox) when a todo is in editing mode. Requires `todomvc-app-css` and `todomvc-common` as dependencies. Pinned by `dom-stability.feature:65` and `editing-controls.feature` scenarios.
+
+2. **removeChild error on empty-edit removal.** When the user saves an empty edit via Enter, `render()` removes the `<li>`. The blur event then fires on the detached edit input, calling `editTodo` again, and `render()` attempts `removeChild` on the already-detached node. The render function must guard `removeChild` with a `parentNode` check. Pinned by new `@conformance` scenario `dom-stability.feature:74`.
+
+Both scenarios fail on current code, confirming the specs pin the defects.
+
